				<string>Stock</string>
				<string>iOS 1-6</string>
				<string>iOS 7</string>
				<string>Liquid Glass</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key><string>Slide to Unlock</string>
			<key>footerText</key><string>EXPERIMENTAL and independent of the skin. Adds a slide-to-unlock bar to the lock screen and hides the "swipe up" hint. The unlock route could not be verified off-device; if it fails the slider snaps back. Off by default. "Disable swipe-up gesture" is riskier still: leave it off unless you have confirmed the slider unlocks your device (a Face ID device could otherwise be stuck on the lock screen; the kill switch file is the way out).</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key><false/>
			<key>defaults</key><string>com.kolby.sk1n</string>
